    "name": "oblador/react-native-progress",
    "descriptionZh": "React Native 的进度与加载指示器组件，Bar、Circle、Pie、CircleSnail 各自成文件，渲染走 react-native-svg。",
    "takeawayZh": "取进度条的四种形态：Bar、Circle、Pie。",
    "noteZh": "仓库根目录一眼能数出 Bar.js、Circle.js、CircleSnail.js、Pie.js 四个组件文件，外加 withAnimation.js 和 Example/、Shapes/ 两个目录。README 一句 “Progress indicators and spinners for React Native using React Native SVG.”，标题按 Installation、Usage、Examples、Changelog、Thanks、License 排下来。提交记录里能看到 “Support RTL for Progress.Bar” 和把 @react-native-community/art 迁到 react-native-svg 的两条，说明图形底层换过一次。侧栏是 MIT license、3.7k stars、507 forks、Used by 27K，最新版本 5.0.1。",
